menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_TOUCH_INPUT
    bool "Enable touch input and gestures"
    default n
    help
        Applies the guardian's touch configuration (enable, tap, swipe,
        long-press, haptic feedback, sensitivity and rotation) and classifies
        taps, swipes and long presses from bounded samples. The module only
        touches input state, so a device without a touch panel never links it.

endmenu
